<title>CHINA: Hainan Airlines opens up 10.21 pct.</title>
<headline>Hainan Airlines opens up 10.21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hainan Airlines Co's 71 million B shares, making their debut on the Shanghai stock exchange on Thursday, opened up 10.21 percent at $0.518 against an initial offer price of $0.47.</p>
</text>
